# lib/ standard

Read [`skills/lib-standard/SKILL.md`](../skills/lib-standard/SKILL.md) before adding files under `lib/`.

- One domain folder per module: `lib/wallet/`, `lib/live/`, `lib/bucket/`
- camelCase filenames: `sessionStore.ts`, `icpAddress.ts` — no kebab-case at lib root
- Pure helpers only — no React, no canister calls (those go in `services/`)
- Import: `@/lib/<module>/<file>` — never `@/lib/wallet-utils` style flat paths
- `cn()` lives at `@/lib/ui/utils`
